Package: langclass
Type: Package
Title: Language Classification with Naive Bayes and Stopwords
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alisson", "Soares", 
    email="soares.alisson@yahoo.com.br", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"), 
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-5497-5572" ) )
Maintainer: Alisson Soares <soares.alisson@yahoo.com.br>
Description: A fast language classifier built on top of the 'stopwords'
    package. It trains a Naive Bayes model using stopword lists for dozens
    of languages and can identify the language of a text or a vector of
    texts. A pre-trained classifier covering all languages available in the
    'stopwords' package is shipped with the package, so classification works
    out of the box.
